      "moodBoard": {
        "text": "This collection is an exploration of Functional Love, the kind of affection that isn’t found in grand gestures, but in the gritty, daily resilience of the modern woman. Inspired by the character of Piku, this collection serves as a sartorial tribute to the woman who is the silent anchor of her home; the woman who balances the precision of an architect with the messy, unpredictable demands of a woman.\n\nIn a world that demands women to be soft, this collection celebrates the strength in being “sharp.” It honors the irritability that comes from exhaustion and the beauty found in a life lived for others without losing one's own intellectual identity",
        "images": [
            "/photos/pehchan_moodboard (1).jpeg",
            "/photos/pehchan_moodboard (2).jpeg",
            "/photos/pehchan_moodboard (3).jpeg",
            "/photos/pehchan_moodboard (4).jpeg",
            "/photos/pehchan_moodboard (5).jpeg",
            "/photos/pehchan_moodboard (6).jpeg"
        ]
      },
      "inspiration": "Inspired by the character of Piku"
    },
