      "moodBoard": {
        "text": "UMA draws inspiration from the grandeur of Durga Puja in Kolkata, capturing the essence of celebration, tradition, and feminine strength. Inspired by the iconic Laal-Paar shada saree, a symbol of purity and power, the designs reinterpret this cultural classic with modern silhouettes and contemporary aesthetics. The vision is to blend the timeless charm of red and white with innovative cuts, drapes, and detailing, making it relevant for today’s generation while honouring its deep-rooted heritage. Each piece embodies the spirit of the festive—graceful, powerful, and celebratory—offering men and women an ensemble that bridges the gap between ritual and runway.",
        "images": [
          "/photos/hero_img_1.webp",
          "/photos/hero_img_2.webp",
          "/photos/hero_img_3.webp",
          "/photos/hero_img_4.webp",
          "/photos/hero_img_5.webp",
          "/photos/hero_img_6.webp"
        ]
      },
      "inspiration": "Inspired by the iconic Laal Paar- Shada Saree. "
